build _build/ocaml/passes.cmx: ocaml_module lib/passes.ml | _build/ocaml/passes.cmi _build/ocaml/ir.cmx _build/ocaml/shape.cmx

build _build/ocaml/metal.cmi: ocaml_interface lib/metal.mli | _build/ocaml/ir.cmi
build _build/ocaml/metal.cmx: ocaml_module lib/metal.ml | _build/ocaml/metal.cmi _build/ocaml/ir.cmx

