build _build/bin/llmopt-fx: ocaml_link _build/ocaml/shape.cmx _build/ocaml/ir.cmx _build/ocaml/tile_effect.cmx _build/ocaml/capture.cmx _build/ocaml/fx.cmx _build/ocaml/fx_plan.cmx _build/ocaml/passes.cmx _build/ocaml/metal.cmx _build/ocaml/llvm_ir.cmx _build/ocaml/fx_compile.cmx

build _build/fx-example/plan.txt _build/fx-example/kernel.metal _build/fx-example/kernel.ll: fx_manifest python/examples/linear_fx.json | _build/bin/llmopt-fx
build _build/fx-example/kernel.ll.o: llvm_check _build/fx-example/kernel.ll
build _build/fx-example/kernel.air: metal_check _build/fx-example/kernel.metal

build _build/q8-fx-example/plan.txt _build/q8-fx-example/kernel.metal _build/q8-fx-example/kernel.ll: q8_fx_manifest python/examples/q8_linear_fx.json | _build/bin/llmopt-fx
build _build/q8-fx-example/kernel.ll.o: llvm_check _build/q8-fx-example/kernel.ll
