build _artifacts/phase1-350m-mps/result.json: metal_runtime_model_smoke _build/bin/llmopt-fx _build/native/metal-runtime.stamp bench/lfm25_mps.py python/llmopt_backend/__init__.py python/llmopt_backend/metal_runtime.py python/llmopt_backend/quantization.py
